{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01129","headline":"相和歌辞 铜雀台 · 王无竞","name":"相和歌辞 铜雀台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北登铜雀上，西望青松郭。\n繐帐空苍苍，陵田纷漠漠。\n平生事已变，歌吹宛犹昨。\n长袖拂玉麈，遗情结罗幕。\n妾怨在朝露，君恩岂中薄。\n高台奏曲终，曲终泪横落。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王无竞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}